---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import siteConfig from '../data/site.config.json';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Privacy policy | ${siteConfig.siteName}`} description="Privacy policy">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 720px;">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This policy covers the personal data collected through the quote form on this website. There is no public email address or phone line - the form is the only way to contact us.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit the quote form we collect the name, phone number, email address and project details you provide, along with the page (city and service) you submitted it from and your IP address.</p>

    <h2>How it's used</h2>
    <p>This information is used only to respond to your enquiry and to match you with local installers who can quote for the work. It is delivered to us by email through Resend, our transactional email provider, and passed to the relevant installers. It is not sold, and not shared with anyone else.</p>

    <h2>Spam protection</h2>
    <p>Submissions are checked with Cloudflare Turnstile, a privacy-friendly bot-detection service, before being processed. Turnstile does not use tracking cookies.</p>

    <h2>Who processes your data</h2>
    <p>This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages (hosting and Turnstile) and email is sent through Resend. Both act as data processors on our behalf.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>This site does not use tracking cookies or third-party analytics.</p>

    <h2>Your rights and contact</h2>
    <p>To ask what data we hold about you, or to have it corrected or deleted, use the <a href="/quote">quote form</a> and put your request in the project details field. We will action it and reply to the email address you provide.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
